---
// Hero.astro (Executive Minimalist - Pure Light Theme, No Emojis)
---

<section id="inicio" class="hero-section">
  <div class="hero-container">
    <div class="hero-content">
      <!-- Institutional Category Tag -->
      <div class="inst-tag">
        <span class="tag-bullet"></span>
        <span>Gobernanza Climática • Criterios ESG • Transición Energética</span>
      </div>

      <h1 class="hero-name">
        Delia Guadalupe <br/>
        <span class="text-accent-gradient">Robles Galeana</span>
      </h1>

      <p class="hero-role-title">
        Coordinadora de Sustentabilidad & Especialista en Transición Energética
      </p>

      <p class="hero-subrole">
        Ingeniera en Sistemas Energéticos y Redes Inteligentes (IPN - UPIEM)
      </p>

      <!-- Clean, Professional Pitch -->
      <p class="hero-statement">
        Lidero la estructuración y coordinación de programas de sostenibilidad, descarbonización y resiliencia socioambiental. Seleccionada institucional para el proyecto nacional del vehículo eléctrico <strong>Olinia</strong> y galardonada con el <strong>Premio InnoDrop</strong> por el desarrollo de bioplásticos purificadores de agua (IPN), integro investigación con <strong>CINVESTAV, CICATA y UNAM</strong> para articular viabilidad técnica, cumplimiento regulatorio y los <strong>Objetivos de Desarrollo Sostenible (ODS)</strong>.
      </p>

      <!-- Credenciales institucionales sin emojis (SVG minimalistas) -->
      <div class="credentials-grid">
        <div class="cred-card">
          <svg class="cred-icon" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2"><path d="M3 21h18M3 10h18M5 6l7-3 7 3M4 10v11M20 10v11M8 14v4M12 14v4M16 14v4"/></svg>
          <span class="cred-title">Políticas Públicas & Regulación ESG</span>
        </div>
        <div class="cred-card">
          <svg class="cred-icon" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2"><rect x="1" y="3" width="15" height="13"></rect><polygon points="16 8 20 8 23 11 23 16 16 16 16 8"></polygon><circle cx="5.5" cy="18.5" r="2.5"></circle><circle cx="18.5" cy="18.5" r="2.5"></circle></svg>
          <span class="cred-title">Seleccionada Vehículo Eléctrico Olinia</span>
        </div>
        <div class="cred-card">
          <svg class="cred-icon" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2"><path d="M12 2.69l5.66 5.66a8 8 0 1 1-11.31 0z"/></svg>
          <span class="cred-title">Premio InnoDrop (Biotecnología Hídrica)</span>
        </div>
        <div class="cred-card">
          <svg class="cred-icon" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2"><path d="M4 19.5A2.5 2.5 0 0 1 6.5 17H20"/><path d="M6.5 2H20v20H6.5A2.5 2.5 0 0 1 4 19.5v-15A2.5 2.5 0 0 1 6.5 2z"/></svg>
          <span class="cred-title">Investigadora Publicada en Springer Nature</span>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="hero-actions">
        <a href="#proyectos" class="btn-primary">
          <span>Ver Iniciativas</span>
          <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="15" height="15" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2"><line x1="5" y1="12" x2="19" y2="12"></line><polyline points="12 5 19 12 12 19"></polyline></svg>
        </a>

        <a href="/CV_Delia_Robles.pdf" download="Dossier_Delia_Robles.pdf" class="btn-secondary">
          <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="15" height="15" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2"><path d="M21 15v4a2 2 0 0 1-2 2H5a2 2 0 0 1-2-2v-4"/><polyline points="7 10 12 15 17 10"/><line x1="12" y1="15" x2="12" y2="3"/></svg>
          <span>Descargar Dossier / CV</span>
        </a>

        <a href="#contacto" class="btn-text">
          <span>Contacto Institucional</span>
        </a>
      </div>
    </div>

    <!-- Executive Dossier Sidebar Card -->
    <div class="hero-sidebar">
      <div class="dossier-card">
        <div class="dossier-header">
          <span class="badge-status-light">Perfil Ejecutivo</span>
          <span class="availability-indicator">Disponible para Proyectos</span>
        </div>

        <div class="profile-header-group">
          <div class="profile-photo-box">
            <img src="/images/delia_laboratorio_sintesis.jpg" alt="Delia Guadalupe Robles Galeana" class="profile-avatar-img" />
          </div>
          <div>
            <h3 class="dossier-name">Delia G. Robles Galeana</h3>
            <p class="dossier-charge">Coordinadora de Sustentabilidad</p>
            <p class="dossier-loc">Ciudad de México • Alcance Internacional</p>
          </div>
        </div>

        <hr class="dossier-divider" />

        <div class="metrics-row">
          <div class="metric-cell">
            <span class="m-val">2+</span>
            <span class="m-lbl">Capítulos Springer</span>
          </div>
          <div class="metric-cell">
            <span class="m-val">1º</span>
            <span class="m-lbl">Premio InnoDrop</span>
          </div>
          <div class="metric-cell">
            <span class="m-val">ODS</span>
            <span class="m-lbl">Agenda 2030</span>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="quote-callout">
          <p>
            "La sostenibilidad efectiva vincula el rigor técnico de la ingeniería con marcos de política pública transparentes y de alto impacto social."
          </p>
        </div>

        <div class="affil-tags-group">
          <span class="affil-pill">IPN</span>
          <span class="affil-pill">CINVESTAV</span>
          <span class="affil-pill">UNAM</span>
          <span class="affil-pill">UNESCO</span>
          <span class="affil-pill">INAES</span>
          <span class="affil-pill">NASA ARSET</span>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<style>
  .hero-section {
    padding: 7.5rem 1.5rem 4.5rem 1.5rem;
    background-color: #ffffff !important;
    border-bottom: 1px solid #e2e8f0 !important;
  }

  .hero-container {
    max-width: 1200px;
    margin: 0 auto;
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 1.25fr 0.85fr;
    gap: 3.5rem;
    align-items: start;
  }

  .inst-tag {
    display: inline-flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 0.5rem;
    background-color: #f0fdf4 !important;
    border: 1px solid #bbf7d0 !important;
    padding: 0.35rem 0.85rem;
    border-radius: 4px;
    font-size: 0.75rem;
    font-weight: 700;
    color: #047857 !important;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    letter-spacing: 0.05em;
    margin-bottom: 1.25rem;
  }

  .tag-bullet {
    width: 6px;
    height: 6px;
    background-color: #047857;
    border-radius: 50%;
  }

  .hero-name {
    font-size: 3.15rem;
    font-weight: 800;
    line-height: 1.15;
    color: #0f172a !important;
    letter-spacing: -0.03em;
    margin-bottom: 0.6rem;
  }

  .hero-role-title {
    font-size: 1.25rem;
    font-weight: 700;
    color: #0284c7 !important;
    margin-bottom: 0.35rem;
  }

  .hero-subrole {
    font-size: 0.975rem;
    font-weight: 600;
    color: #475569 !important;
    margin-bottom: 1.5rem;
  }

  .hero-statement {
    font-size: 1.025rem;
    line-height: 1.7;
    color: #334155 !important;
    margin-bottom: 1.75rem;
    max-width: 600px;
  }

  .hero-statement strong {
    color: #0f172a !important;
    font-weight: 700;
  }

  .credentials-grid {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: repeat(2, 1fr);
    gap: 0.65rem;
    margin-bottom: 2.25rem;
    max-width: 600px;
  }

  .cred-card {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 0.6rem;
    background-color: #f8fafc !important;
    border: 1px solid #e2e8f0 !important;
    padding: 0.55rem 0.85rem;
    border-radius: 6px;
  }

  .cred-icon {
    color: #047857 !important;
    flex-shrink: 0;
  }

  .cred-title {
    font-size: 0.8rem;
    font-weight: 600;
    color: #334155 !important;
    line-height: 1.3;
  }

  .hero-actions {
    display: flex;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
    gap: 0.85rem;
    align-items: center;
  }

  .btn-primary {
    display: inline-flex !important;
    align-items: center !important;
    gap: 0.5rem !important;
    padding: 0.75rem 1.45rem !important;
    background-color: #047857 !important;
    color: #ffffff !important;
    font-weight: 700 !important;
    font-size: 0.875rem !important;
    border-radius: 6px !important;
    text-decoration: none !important;
    transition: all 0.2s ease;
  }

  .btn-primary:hover {
    background-color: #065f46 !important;
  }

  .btn-secondary {
    display: inline-flex !important;
    align-items: center !important;
    gap: 0.5rem !important;
    padding: 0.75rem 1.35rem !important;
    background-color: #ffffff !important;
    border: 1px solid #cbd5e1 !important;
    color: #0f172a !important;
    font-weight: 600 !important;
    font-size: 0.875rem !important;
    border-radius: 6px !important;
    text-decoration: none !important;
    transition: all 0.2s ease;
  }

  .btn-secondary:hover {
    border-color: #047857 !important;
    color: #047857 !important;
    background-color: #f0fdf4 !important;
  }

  .btn-text {
    font-size: 0.875rem;
    font-weight: 600;
    color: #475569 !important;
    text-decoration: none !important;
    padding: 0.75rem 1rem;
    transition: color 0.2s ease;
  }

  .btn-text:hover {
    color: #047857 !important;
  }

  /* Sidebar Card */
  .hero-sidebar {
    display: flex;
    justify-content: center;
  }

  .dossier-card {
    background-color: #ffffff !important;
    border: 1px solid #e2e8f0 !important;
    border-radius: 10px;
    padding: 2rem;
    width: 100%;
    max-width: 420px;
    box-shadow: 0 4px 16px rgba(15, 23, 42, 0.05);
  }

  .dossier-header {
    display: flex;
    justify-content: space-between;
    align-items: center;
    margin-bottom: 1.35rem;
  }

  .badge-status-light {
    font-size: 0.7rem;
    font-weight: 800;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    letter-spacing: 0.08em;
    color: #0284c7 !important;
    background-color: #e0f2fe !important;
    padding: 0.25rem 0.55rem;
    border-radius: 4px;
  }

  .availability-indicator {
    font-size: 0.75rem;
    font-weight: 600;
    color: #047857 !important;
  }

  .profile-header-group {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 1rem;
    margin-bottom: 1.25rem;
  }

  .profile-photo-box {
    width: 62px;
    height: 62px;
    border-radius: 8px;
    overflow: hidden;
    border: 2px solid #047857 !important;
    background-color: #0f172a;
    box-shadow: 0 4px 10px rgba(4, 120, 87, 0.2);
    flex-shrink: 0;
  }

  .profile-avatar-img {
    width: 100%;
    height: 100%;
    object-fit: cover;
    object-position: center 20%;
    display: block;
  }

  .dossier-name {
    font-size: 1.05rem;
    font-weight: 800;
    color: #0f172a !important;
    line-height: 1.2;
    margin-bottom: 0.2rem;
  }

  .dossier-charge {
    font-size: 0.825rem;
    font-weight: 700;
    color: #047857 !important;
    margin-bottom: 0.2rem;
  }

  .dossier-loc {
    font-size: 0.75rem;
    color: #64748b !important;
  }

  .dossier-divider {
    border: none;
    height: 1px;
    background-color: #e2e8f0 !important;
    margin-bottom: 1.25rem;
  }

  .metrics-row {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: repeat(3, 1fr);
    gap: 0.5rem;
    background-color: #f8fafc !important;
    border: 1px solid #e2e8f0 !important;
    border-radius: 6px;
    padding: 0.75rem 0.5rem;
    text-align: center;
    margin-bottom: 1.25rem;
  }

  .metric-cell {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
  }

  .m-val {
    font-size: 1.15rem;
    font-weight: 800;
    color: #0f172a !important;
  }

  .m-lbl {
    font-size: 0.68rem;
    color: #475569 !important;
    margin-top: 0.15rem;
    line-height: 1.2;
  }

  .quote-callout {
    background-color: #f8fafc !important;
    border-left: 3px solid #047857 !important;
    padding: 0.75rem 0.95rem;
    border-radius: 0 4px 4px 0;
    margin-bottom: 1.25rem;
  }

  .quote-callout p {
    font-size: 0.825rem;
    font-style: italic;
    color: #334155 !important;
    line-height: 1.45;
  }

  .affil-tags-group {
    display: flex;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
    gap: 0.35rem;
  }

  .affil-pill {
    font-size: 0.7rem;
    font-weight: 700;
    background-color: #ffffff !important;
    border: 1px solid #e2e8f0 !important;
    color: #475569 !important;
    padding: 0.2rem 0.5rem;
    border-radius: 4px;
  }

  @media (max-width: 960px) {
    .hero-container {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr;
    }
    .hero-name {
      font-size: 2.5rem;
    }
  }
</style>
